{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PbGqMh6wQnc9yBmN2f3Dcj","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Firecrawl G2 reviews rating\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Scrapers / G2\",\"url\":\"https://crawlbase.com/g2-scraper\"},{\"title\":\"G2 Reviews Scraper PRO (Bypass Cloudflare & Filter by Stars) avatar\",\"url\":\"https://apify.com/aetherlabx/g2-reviews-scraper-pro\"},{\"title\":\"Firecrawl Review 2026: B2B Data Coverage, Pricing & SyncGTM Comparison\",\"url\":\"https://syncgtm.com/blog/firecrawl-review-2026\"},{\"title\":\"www.g2.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.g2.com/categories/project-management/enterprise?page=4\"},{\"title\":\"G2 Reviews Scraper 2026 avatar\",\"url\":\"https://apify.com/devcake/g2-reviews/api/cli\"},{\"title\":\"New G2 reviews avatar\",\"url\":\"https://apify.com/dionysus_way/new-g2-reviews?fpr=p2hrc6\"},{\"title\":\"New G2 reviews avatar\",\"url\":\"https://apify.com/dionysus_way/new-g2-reviews\"},{\"title\":\"G2 Reviews Scraper - No Proxy Needed\",\"url\":\"https://apify.com/zhorex/g2-reviews-scraper?fpr=97nrp4\"},{\"title\":\"firecrawl review and alternatives\",\"url\":\"https://thunderbit.com/ko/blog/firecrawl-review-and-alternatives\"}]\n\nThe search didn't turn up Firecrawl's actual G2 rating or review count. The results were mostly G2 scraper tools and third-party reviews.\n\n- **Only rating found is not from G2:** A SyncGTM blog review gives Firecrawl 4.0/5, but that is the blog author's own score. The same post calls it a strong fit for web scraping and a poor fit for B2B contact enrichment. Our rating: 4.0/5 — excellent for web scraping, not built for B2B contact enrichment.\n- **Adoption signals:** The same review reports 40,000+ GitHub stars and 150,000+ companies using the platform. A Korean-language review cites about 111,000 GitHub stars, so the star counts vary by source and date.\n- **Mixed-quality sources:** A Korean review (Thunderbit) discusses real costs and user complaints, particularly around heavily bot-protected sites, but it did not give a G2 score in the excerpt I saw.\n- **Not useful for this question:** The G2 and Apify results are scraper products for pulling G2 reviews. They don't contain Firecrawl's G2 page data. G2 also states that it does not allow paid placements in any of its ratings, rankings, or reports.\n\nTo get the G2 number, check the Firecrawl listing directly on g2.com (search \"Firecrawl\" on the site). Ratings and review counts change over time, so I can't confirm a current figure from these results.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"46b9b7f2-727b-4116-971b-6ada2673d46d","uuid":"d2610ba4-84a5-415a-a71d-7d27ab636060","timestamp":"2026-10-17T17:34:21.136Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Firecrawl G2 reviews rating","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01AFvkz8K3j3iAmv5wWMP8Pi","content":[{"title":"Scrapers / G2","url":"https://crawlbase.com/g2-scraper"},{"title":"G2 Reviews Scraper PRO (Bypass Cloudflare & Filter by Stars) avatar","url":"https://apify.com/aetherlabx/g2-reviews-scraper-pro"},{"title":"Firecrawl Review 2026: B2B Data Coverage, Pricing & SyncGTM Comparison","url":"https://syncgtm.com/blog/firecrawl-review-2026"},{"title":"www.g2.com","url":"https://www.g2.com/categories/project-management/enterprise?page=4"},{"title":"G2 Reviews Scraper 2026 avatar","url":"https://apify.com/devcake/g2-reviews/api/cli"},{"title":"New G2 reviews avatar","url":"https://apify.com/dionysus_way/new-g2-reviews?fpr=p2hrc6"},{"title":"New G2 reviews avatar","url":"https://apify.com/dionysus_way/new-g2-reviews"},{"title":"G2 Reviews Scraper - No Proxy Needed","url":"https://apify.com/zhorex/g2-reviews-scraper?fpr=97nrp4"},{"title":"firecrawl review and alternatives","url":"https://thunderbit.com/ko/blog/firecrawl-review-and-alternatives"}]},"The search didn't turn up Firecrawl's actual G2 rating or review count. T